default reject more_itertools.more.SequenceView.__len__, more_itertools.more.numeric_range.__len__, more_itertools.more.sized_iterator.__len__: this site measures, truth-tests or converts (length hint) no SequenceView, numeric_range or sized_iterator; the sites that do so with a role value accept these explicitly
default reject more_itertools.more.numeric_range.__bool__, more_itertools.more.peekable.__bool__, more_itertools.more.seekable.__bool__: no numeric_range, peekable or seekable is truth-tested at this site; the tested value is a builtin or library object, a number, or a client value outside the iterable role (header)
